  <section id="Cropland-Extent-(2019)">
<h1>Cropland Extent (2019)<a class="headerlink" href="#Cropland-Extent-(2019)" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h1>
<nav class="contents local" id="contents">
<ul class="simple">
