</tr>
<tr class="row-odd"><td><p>Cell size - X (metres)</p></td>
<td><p>10</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class="row-even"><td><p>Cell size - Y (metres)</p></td>
<td><p>10</p></td>
</tr>
